      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Encountered this when uploading the free Amriot avatar by Omatssu on gumroad.\n\nThe scene has Fallback, Quest, and PC versions of the avatar all active by default. With the fallback version already uploaded to all platforms and selected in the SDKs builder tab, it says it can not be used as a fallback. After toggling the active state of the other versions, and tabbing off and back on to the SDKs builder tab will it then update that it can be used as fallback.\n\nToggling the other versions back on, and tabbing off and on to the SDKs builder tab makes it once again say it can not be used as fallback.",
