      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} Just ran into this issue in SDK 3.7.5. It says to check validations but the validations say it's Good rated with no other notices. There are two other versions of the avatar in the scene (PC etc.) that are Medium rated on Android. \n\nUploading on PC first, then Android. Both Good rated on their respective platform. The only thing that fixes it is deleting the other avatars from the scene. Disabling them does not alleviate it. After deleting them and then Undoing, the button stays available.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
